<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 60.81 to 7022.44, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.54 to 424.42, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.47.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1717 to 820.</p>
<p>Volume was 584,368,420 compared with 563,552,340 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
